  'Tiller and wheel: ' + a('https://www.sailboat-cruising.com/Sailboat-Tillers-vs-Wheel-Steering.html','sailboat-cruising.com') + ', ' + a('https://no-frills-sailing.com/steering-wheels-vs-tiller/','No Frills Sailing') + '; conversion costs from ' + a('https://www.sailnet.com/threads/rough-cost-to-convert-tiller-to-wheel.95158/','SailNet') + ' (US, anecdotal).',
